.DS_Store

# Personal voice specs are private — template is committed, the filled-in doc is not
skills/*/voice/VOICE.md
skills/*/voice/blocklist.txt
skills/*/voice/pairs.md

# Personal context is private: template is committed, everything else in context/ is not
skills/*/context/*
!skills/*/context/*.template.md

# Product overlays are per-machine — template is committed, the filled-in doc is not
skills/*/product/PRODUCT.md
